  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Minelab Equinox beach detecting with the 15x12 dd smart coil, settings for the equinox and large coil still going under testing but what i am using at the minute are stable and quick in the deep iron and trash on the beach. following the tide out today looking for low spots and other areas that possibly hold the goodies, we pick up some silver pre-decimal coins and a .925 silver ring which is i think quite old.."
